node -e "const sharp=require('sharp');const fs=require('fs');const path=require('path');const dir='./images';fs.readdirSync(dir).filter(f=>f.endsWith('.jpg')||f.endsWith('.png')).forEach(f=>{const input=path.join(dir,f);const output=path.join(dir,f.replace('.png','.jpg'));const tmp=output+'.tmp';sharp(input).resize({width:1600,withoutEnlargement:true}).jpeg({quality:80}).toFile(tmp).then(()=>{fs.renameSync(tmp,output);if(f.endsWith('.png'))fs.unlinkSync(input);console.log('Done: '+f);});});"
Write-Host "All images converted and resized successfully!" -ForegroundColor Green
pause
node -e "const sharp=require('sharp');const fs=require('fs');const path=require('path');const dir='./images';const exts=['.jpg','.png','.webp','.avif'];fs.readdirSync(dir).filter(f=>exts.some(e=>f.endsWith(e))).forEach(f=>{const input=path.join(dir,f);const output=path.join(dir,f.replace(/\.(png|webp|avif)$/,'.jpg'));const tmp=output+'.tmp';sharp(input).resize({width:1600,withoutEnlargement:true}).jpeg({quality:80}).toFile(tmp).then(()=>{fs.renameSync(tmp,output);if(!f.endsWith('.jpg'))fs.unlinkSync(input);console.log('Done: '+f);});});"
Write-Host "All images converted and resized successfully!" -ForegroundColor Green
pause
